---
title: "SSD: Publish Schedule (UC-08)"
---
sequenceDiagram
    actor Manager
    participant System as :System
    loop once for every shift the manager fills
        Manager->>System: assign(shiftId, employeeId)
        System-->>Manager: saved, plus the current violations
    end
    Manager->>System: validate()
    System-->>Manager: violation list
    Manager->>System: publish()
    alt nothing blocking
        System-->>Manager: published, everyone on it notified
    else blocking violations open
        System-->>Manager: refused, period stays in draft
    end
